WEBVTT

00:07:56.330 --> 00:08:00.030
I picked up the phone one day,
called him and said,

00:08:00.030 --> 00:08:03.063
"I bet if it were up to you,

00:08:03.063 --> 00:08:06.563
you'd probably go back in time
and change some things.

00:08:07.563 --> 00:08:08.930
I know I would.

00:08:10.263 --> 00:08:12.397
But since we can't,

00:08:12.430 --> 00:08:14.263
how about we start again?"

00:08:15.930 --> 00:08:17.430
And he said,

00:08:17.463 --> 00:08:20.363
"Yes, because I love you.

00:08:20.363 --> 00:08:23.797
I always have. And I always will."

00:08:26.363 --> 00:08:31.197
I am so grateful that I made that call